        "page_provenance": [{"pdf_page": 8, "printed_page": 7}]
      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "(Reading the newspaper.) The world war at its peak—Japan's war preparations! Enemies off the Rangoon coast; the ships have not reached India—brother, if Father and little sister hear this news, they'll be terribly upset. The wedding arrangements must be going on in full swing.",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": ["The compressed source sequence around `இரங்கூன் கடலோரங்களில் எதிரிகள் கப்பல்கள் இந்தியா போய்ச் சேரவில்லை` is preserved conservatively; the English does not add a causal claim that is not explicit in the Tamil."]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "parasakthi-en-s005-u003",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "status": "review",
      "target_language": "en",
      "canonical_scene": 5,
      "source": {
        "source_path": "works/parasakthi/dialogues/records/scene-05.json",
        "canonical_scene_path": "works/parasakthi/scenes/scene-05.md",
        "source_record_id": "parasakthi-s005-d002",
        "speaker_label": "சந்திர",
        "page_provenance": [{"pdf_page": 9, "printed_page": 8}]
      },
      "translation": {"english_text": "Yes. The ship Gunasekaran left on apparently still hasn't even reached Madras. We've become wretches unable to see our sister in her bridal attire.", "mode": "prose-faithful", "notes": []}
    },
    {
      "id": "parasakthi-en-s005-u004",
      "kind": "stage-direction",
      "status": "review",
      "target_language": "en",
      "canonical_scene": 5,
      "source": {
        "source_path": "works/parasakthi/scenes/scene-05.md",
        "canonical_scene_path": "works/parasakthi/scenes/scene-05.md",
        "source_locator": {"kind": "scene-bracketed-direction", "ordinal": 2, "description": "Radio war-news direction between the second and third dialogue records."},
        "page_provenance": [{"pdf_page": 9, "printed_page": 8}]
      },
      "translation": {"english_text": "[At this moment war news is broadcast on the radio. Today, enemy bombing caused heavy damage... about a thousand people were killed. An entire city in Burma has been emptied.]", "mode": "prose-faithful", "notes": []}
    },
    {
      "id": "parasakthi-en-s005-u005",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "status": "review",
      "target_language": "en",
      "canonical_scene": 5,
      "source": {
        "source_path": "works/parasakthi/dialogues/records/scene-05.json",
        "canonical_scene_path": "works/parasakthi/scenes/scene-05.md",
        "source_record_id": "parasakthi-s005-d003",
        "speaker_label": "சந்",
        "page_provenance": [{"pdf_page": 9, "printed_page": 8}]
      },
      "translation": {"english_text": "How many more days can we go on living like this?", "mode": "prose-faithful", "notes": []}
    },
    {
      "id": "parasakthi-en-s005-u006",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "status": "review",
      "target_language": "en",
      "canonical_scene": 5,
      "source": {
        "source_path": "works/parasakthi/dialogues/records/scene-05.json",
        "canonical_scene_path": "works/parasakthi/scenes/scene-05.md",
        "source_record_id": "parasakthi-s005-d004",
        "speaker_label": "ஞான",
        "page_provenance": [{"pdf_page": 9, "printed_page": 8}]
      },
      "translation": {"english_text": "It feels as though simply escaping alive is a great struggle.", "mode": "prose-faithful", "notes": []}
    },
    {
      "id": "parasakthi-en-s005-u007",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "status": "review",
      "target_language": "en",
      "canonical_scene": 5,
      "source": {
        "source_path": "works/parasakthi/dialogues/records/scene-05.json",
        "canonical_scene_path": "works/parasakthi/scenes/scene-05.md",
        "source_record_id": "parasakthi-s005-d005",
        "speaker_label": "சந்",
        "page_provenance": [{"pdf_page": 9, "printed_page": 8}]
      },
      "translation": {"english_text": "We shouldn't stay here any longer. Even if we have to walk, let's reach India.", "mode": "prose-faithful", "notes": []}
    },
